--- Acceptance Criteria ---
[x] Surface renders all web states: empty em-dash (no toggle) / masked / revealed (auto-hide) x copyable.
[x] No data hook in the view (pure presentational, like web source); reveal-audit is the dependency-
    inverted RevealAuditSink (no direct HTTP). P1/S8 data port N/A and documented in MaskedValueModel.kt.
[x] i18n: every label (mask.reveal/hide/copy) resolves through P1/S10; zero English literals shipped.
[x] Accessibility: value carries its semantic name (web aria-label); reveal/hide + copy are separate
    focusable buttons each with a state-mirroring contentDescription; Material 48dp touch targets.
[x] Tests: MaskedValueModelTest (masking math + projection adapter) + MaskedValueDiagnosticsTest (PII-safe
    view.opened) + MaskedValueUiTest (per-state + auto-hide + a11y + diagnostics).
[x] No TODO/stub/mock/placeholder/Lorem in shipped code (PLACEHOLDER_COUNT=0 on all files).

